acts or validation steps not present in the execution facts. If the original user requested an explicit final-answer format, titled sections, or required headings, the final_answer must preserve that requested shape. Do not close with a progress note, future-work narration, raw tool transcript, or a prose summary that omits required headings. Set mutation_claimed=true only when final_answer claims the current turn changed files in the user workspace. Publishing result, report, or review artifacts alone does not count, nor does describing or verifying another actor's earlier edits. If the answer also claims current-turn workspace file edits, set mutation_claimed=true; those edits still require successful file-write or file-edit evidence. External service, account, or network state changes do not count as workspace mutations.\"}\n\n[JUDGE CONTEXT]\ncandidate_reason: act_adaptive_final_text\naction_summary: {\"number\": 102, \"body\": \"Hi, thanks for your work on this. The agreed ETA was 2026-11-12, and it has now passed. Following the CONTRIBUTING guidance to give contributors room and to ask for an update when an agreed date slips, we wanted to check in. Are you still working on this? A short status update would be very helpful. If we don't hear back by 2026-11-20, we'll follow up again here. From 2026-11-23, the issue may be opened up for someone else to take over. If you need more time, just let us know.\"}\nclosure_action_outputs: {\"tool_results\": [{\"tool_name\": \"submit_draft\", \"ok\": true, \"verified\": true}], \"tool_execution_count\": 1, \"tool_name_sequence\": [\"submit_draft\"], \"adaptive.termination_reason\": \"final_text\", \"adaptive.tool_calls\": [\"submit_draft\"], \"adaptive.tool_calls_total\": 1, \"adaptive.finalization_status\": {\"status\": \"final_answer\", \"reasoning\": \"Draft submitted via submit_draft and returned as the requested JSON object.\", \"remaining_work\": \"\", \"blocking_reason\": \"\"}}\n\nActive state: <runtime-state>\n\n